# Testing & validation

## Rust

- Domain gates: `cargo test -p talaria-quality`
- Sources (fixtures): `cargo test -p talaria-sources`
- Broader: `cargo test` / `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features` (pre-existing warnings OK)

## Web

- `cd web && npm run build` — no separate test script configured.

## Reporting

Separate **errors** from **warnings**. For multi-file tasks: implement → targeted tests → build → report leftovers.
